    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23468" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δᾱρεῖος</span></b> , ὁ,
			<u>Darius</u> (O<i><span class="en">
			Pers.
		</span></i>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Dārayavauš
				'upholder of the Good'</i>), name of several kings of Persia;
			acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.98
			</span></i>, = Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρξίης</span>
			(q.v.):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαρειαὶος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.1.8
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ctes.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				29.49
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαρῐάν</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				651
			</span></i> (lyr.): <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαριήκης</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.4.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a throw of
			the dice, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
